{"clause_id": "c246", "issues": [
  {"issue": "The final proviso excepts 'investments in units of money market funds pursuant to clause (v) above', but clause (v) is guaranteed reinvestment agreements while money market funds are clause (viii). The mis-numbered internal reference leaves the redemption-below-cost carve-out without an identifiable subject.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.27},
  {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.10}]},
