{"clause_id": "c252", "issues": [
  {"issue": "The deduction in clause (ii) subtracts '(b) the Master Servicing Fee Rate' — a per annum rate — from a dollar amount of interest, where the parallel items are fees expressed as amounts. The formula as written cannot be computed literally.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.26},
  {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.11}]},
