{"clause_id": "c256", "issues": [
  {"issue": "Clause (e) counts Substitution Adjustment Amounts arising from substitution 'pursuant to Section 2.03(d)', but Section 2.03 has no subsection (d); its substitution mechanics are in unlettered paragraphs and the repurchase obligation itself lives in the Mortgage Loan Purchase Agreement. The cross-reference cannot be reconciled with Section 2.03 as written.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.28},
  {"issue": null, "type": 1, "prob": 0.12}]},
